*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

# Playwright
test-results/
playwright-report/

# Packaging staging output (regenerated by scripts/stage-sidecar.mjs).
#
# LEADING SLASH IS LOAD-BEARING. Unanchored, `build/` also matches app/build/, which is
# electron-builder's `buildResources` directory (app/electron-builder.yml:17) and holds
# entitlements.mac.plist and the app icon. Anything added there under an unanchored rule is
# silently unstageable — you `git add` an icon, see nothing happen, and ship an icon-less DMG.
/build/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Content staging trees
#
# Each content module is authored into a staging tree and merged into
# content/core-en/data/*.jsonl by the matching tools/content/merge_*.py. Only the authoring
# CONTRACT is tracked — DESIGN.md, TEMPLATE.json and research/ — because that is what a
# second author needs in order to write more. The bulk merge input is not.
#
# NOTE: this policy is applied to four of the seven staging trees. staging-grammar/,
# staging-theory/ and staging-oxford/ do not follow it — see docs/REPOSITORY.md §3 for the
# decision that has not been made yet, and the exact commands for either answer. Do not add
# rules for those three here without untracking what is already committed in the same commit;
# a half-applied rule is worse than either answer, because the files stay in the index and
# every later edit to them becomes invisible.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
content/core-en/staging/sets/
content/core-en/staging-writing/prompts/
content/core-en/staging-reading/tests/
content/core-en/staging-listening/tests/

# The dev data directory. `scripts/dev.mjs` puts the learner's whole runtime here: downloaded
# model weights (hundreds of MB, and never ours to redistribute — that is the entire reason
# stage-sidecar does not bundle them), synthesized listening audio, the SQLite database, the
# sidecar's auth secret, and recordings of the user's own voice.
#
# None of it belongs in the repo, and one 461MB weight file is over GitHub's hard limit, so a
# push carrying it is rejected outright.
.dev-data/

# Agent worktrees. Created by isolated subagents, removed when they finish; never content.
.claude/worktrees/
